SUMMARY:The Attention Economy - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, September 27th\n1st Da
 nce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Danc
 e Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilit
 ator Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: The Attention Economy\n\nWhat do we pay when
  we pay attention?\n\n## About Ted Riskin\n\nTed is interested in anything
  that can get him out of his head\, and music and movement do a pretty goo
 d job of that. He hopes to offer music that facilitates an inner journey a
 nd invitations that create a shift. While he likes modern electronic music
 \, he can’t create a mix without including lots of natural instruments a
 nd voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in lots of different m
 usical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [https://www.mixcloud.com
 /tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please no
 te that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening C
 ircle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ens
 ure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name 
 your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Rec
 ommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for fre
 e! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/vol
 unteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0b
 gNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA
 4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nr
 jKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at th
 e beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIR
 CLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcolle
 ctive.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?f
 bclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMj
 AzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttU
 v2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Colle
 ctive envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be the
 ir authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to 
 inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by host
 ing dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)
 (3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805
 \n\nSee you on the dance floor!
