SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, October 2nd\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFa
 cilitator Kris Hostikka (Kristikka)\n\nIntention: Levity Obscuro\n\nAs the
  leaves fall and the earth draws her breath inward\, we too are invited to
  soften\, sink\, and return to what is real. We step into the mystery—fe
 eling our way through the dark\, trusting the body to know what the mind c
 annot see. Let us meet the unknown with curiosity\, courage\, and a little
  mischief\; perhaps the great mystery has a sense of humor too. May we fee
 l the weight of our bodies\, the pulse of the blood\, the wildness beneath
  the skin. Tonight\, we dance with all of it: the shadow and the spark\, t
 he grief and the joy\, the animal and the divine. Nothing to hide\, nothin
 g to fix—just this wild\, beautiful life moving through us\, laughing as
  we find our way home.\n\n## About Kristikka\n\nKristikka loves creating a
  sacred container that takes you on an inward journey utilizing rhythm to 
 move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down into stillness and integra
 tion. She feels that movement is medicine\, weaving intention and a rich b
 lend of world beats where it’s possible to be with what is and open to w
 hat wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can find her dance mixes here: 
 [http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka](http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka)\n
 \n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The do
 ors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned
  away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTi
 cket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack 
 of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need voluntee
 rs. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashe
 villemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollectiv
 e.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNy
 dGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLw
 gnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCE
 MENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please n
 ote: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n
 [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmF
 lam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71U
 KxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout
  AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmo
 ny where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving communi
 ty. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community 
 through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community 
 transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50
  Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
